G3f-NRFcbwlL2srjZyPMLY1lun5KA&oe=6AE74BCB"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence (1)_007_0013.png", "id": "1573288034173285", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823930_1573288037506618_773887071614618257_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7jIkQfUv-74Q7kNvwG3uuH2&_nc_oc=Adp2yvJVsRIev5pJR8G9PUj8PWqcyzFPQ0gtwF6a1g1JvPImEtZ1oQhY8q9T2SrzsLg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT8UNoVh3EUeWh8-vTPImodJ7jApp3QkspmWwM4-xUspw&oe=6AE750E3"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence (1)_008_0060.png", "id": "1395428362785446", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823351_1395428366118779_7239919769348109029_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l2RTA10_u5YQ7kNvwGMeFb9&_nc_oc=Adqw-X_xJfu6OvgaUzFIwLip1vS5eJdODNLC7Zw9nEjmwdeclkkTZUDAm8vOXh307TU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQwblp9snNq348tLA9X7s7rhnV1zOspVSE1pfy4xXzPuw&oe=6AE768AF"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence (1)_004_0000.png", "id": "1607765430816714", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823757_1607765434150047_4040696890655150120_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DeWwI8BvSzkQ7kNvwGH5mf1&_nc_oc=AdqGnxLbLOOb78weucThf7b8IYI5SaBF1hK7w9ICxMhUfpxND_Lk5aAgWlqb9IRo6ao&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ7_7cejKD4Kt0E0XqFBqNNKxwG97Asb_AlumXed3s9vw&oe=6AE76A30"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence (1)_005_0000.png", "id": "4612000859037532", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828008_4612000869037531_6001185295640286499_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qcXaX27sp-UQ7kNvwHCk5l6&_nc_oc=AdpWe_macfcDdiAWWmQFxbIJoEg6gmPD5KoXFJH-FhcjE2VL8CeCPWBuVNhgEruBi8E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSP7wrg5nWjj0O2Sn2cLjHtxvktfz1Qto2u7NB206B6WA&oe=6AE76C68"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Nuveo", "keywords": ["Nuveo"], "long_description": "**See your building come to life, before it's even built.**\n\nNuveo VR bridges the gap between architectural plans and reality. Upload a 3D model of any project, and it becomes an optimized, true-to-scale virtual walkthrough you can experience directly on-site, right inside the unfinished structure.\n\nPlace a printed QR code on the floor of the construction site, put on your headset, and watch the finished interior appear around you at exact 1:1 scale. Walk freely through every room and floor. Check ceiling heights, window views, and spatial flow long before drywall goes up.\n\n**Key features:**\n- True-to-scale visualization calibrated to real-world dimensions\n- Free-roam exploration with no boundary restrictions\n- QR-based spatial anchoring for precise alignment\n- Realistic materials, textures, and lighting\n- Offline-ready, review projects without WiFi on-site\n- Multi-project support tied to your account\n\n**Who it's for:**\n\nBuilt for architects, interior designers, developers, and construction professionals who want to validate design decisions early, reduce costly late-stage changes, and give clients a compelling preview of spaces that don't exist yet.\n\n**Bring your blueprints to life. Walk through tomorrow's building, today.**", "short_description": "Preview your future home before construction is even finished. Nuveo VR projects a complete 3D interior visualization directly into the unfinished building \u2014 just scan a QR code on the floor. Walk freely through the entire space at true 1:1 scale, and see the colors, textures, and lighting exactly as they'll look once complete. The app works offline too, so you can review your project anywhere, even without an internet connection. Built for architects, planners, and developers."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://portal.nuveo.cz/privacy-policy/en", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Virtual Lab s.r.o.", "support_website_url": null, "website_ur